{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2430390/extras/2187464505e2b8c47a3b9ef6aea8de88.poster.avif?t=1772558668\" width=780 height=202 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2430390/extras/2187464505e2b8c47a3b9ef6aea8de88.webm?t=1772558668\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2430390/extras/2187464505e2b8c47a3b9ef6aea8de88.mp4?t=1772558668\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enter a beautiful realm being torn apart by long-forgotten, newly risen dark powers.\u00a0</strong>Through the cracks caused by this upheaval, our world is seeping into theirs. You are called upon to combat the darkness transforming the realm into something terrifying and inhospitable to all life\u2014all except the corrupted <strong>Eternals</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a realm desperate for a savior\u2014to unveil its secrets and fend off the looming catastrophe.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u2694\ufe0f Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udca5 <strong>Nearly every object can be broken down for materials</strong><br>\ud83d\ude4e\u200d\u2640\ufe0f <strong>Meet the denizens of the realm</strong> and help them survive the coming apocalypse<br>\ud83e\udded <strong>Explore a vast world</strong> of beauty\u2014and darkness<br>\ud83c\udfd5\ufe0f <strong>Construct</strong> campsites, outposts, and even houses<br>\ud83d\udde1\ufe0f <strong>Craft equipment</strong> and create custom weapons<br>\ud83d\udee1\ufe0f <strong>Shape your hero</strong> from scratch<br>\ud83d\udd2b <strong>Find and craft dysplaced modern items</strong>\u2014the locals believe they\u2019re magical <br>\ud83e\ude78 <strong>Brew potions</strong> to gain a tactical advantage<br>\ud83e\udd9e <strong>Cook mouth-watering meals</strong> for extra vigor and other boons<br>\ud83e\udddb\u200d\u2642\ufe0f <strong>Fight against the shadowy forces</strong> menacing your new home<br>\ud83c\udfa3 <strong>Fish</strong> in murky, forgotten lakes for mysterious catches<br>\ud83d\udc1d <strong>Catch critters</strong> for crafting\u2014or collect them just because you can</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2430390/extras/21be2cb74eb4081579d97df434cff278.webp?t=1772558668\" alt=\"Forge From The Ruins\" width=780 height=53 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2430390/extras/a0e402ca51959c602b12e25461760930.poster.avif?t=1772558668\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2430390/extras/a0e402ca51959c602b12e25461760930.webm?t=1772558668\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2430390/extras/a0e402ca51959c602b12e25461760930.mp4?t=1772558668\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nearly everything in this massive world is destructible: trees, wheelbarrows, plows, barrels\u2014even houses. Gather materials to learn new skills and craft a wide array of items. Use your axe, hammer, sword or powerful modern tools to <strong>destroy nearly everything</strong>!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2430390/extras/b39f3c782391f6436bb9af91a0970b91.webp?t=1772558668\" alt=\"Craft &amp; Customize\" width=780 height=53 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2430390/extras/21256b7bc8094d849c359fa6e7373d34.poster.avif?t=1772558668\" width=616 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2430390/extras/21256b7bc8094d849c359fa6e7373d34.webm?t=1772558668\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2430390/extras/21256b7bc8094d849c359fa6e7373d34.mp4?t=1772558668\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft and customize a vast array of weapons, armor, and tools to grow stronger. Create gear that fits your playstyle: block and parry with sword and shield, hurl deadly spears, or strike from afar with a bow. Spice it up with scavenged modern artifacts \u2014 grenades, mines, and shotguns \u2014 or build an anvil to mix and match blades and hilts for unique weapon combinations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2430390/extras/9d668a2a2ac8808783040a1b2df14a9e.poster.avif?t=1772558668\" width=616 height=205 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2430390/extras/9d668a2a2ac8808783040a1b2df14a9e.webm?t=1772558668\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2430390/extras/13476528691c69faba52402a7a171b65.webp?t=1772558668\" alt=\"Explore &amp; Build\" width=780 height=53 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2430390/extras/72505378796671eccfcc33dff2e17e7c.poster.avif?t=1772558668\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2430390/extras/72505378796671eccfcc33dff2e17e7c.webm?t=1772558668\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2430390/extras/72505378796671eccfcc33dff2e17e7c.mp4?t=1772558668\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once equipped for the journey, a vast and enchanting realm awaits. Gather resources, hunt wildlife, farm local plants gather herbs, shrooms and berries, uncover hidden treasures, complete mysterious quests, and brave awe-inspiring wonders and dangers alike.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make a campfire, build a workbench, forge, or even a teleporter \u2014 or craft a full house! Venture further by establishing campsites and outposts along the way. A well-equipped outpost can make all the difference when facing the challenges of this strange new frontier.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2430390/extras/a7f92c55faedf6839c5f23017c562ef6.webp?t=1772558668\" alt=\"Dysplaced Artifacts\" width=780 height=53 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2430390/extras/724022aab8d2b27f98ee4c0417e60212.poster.avif?t=1772558668\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2430390/extras/724022aab8d2b27f98ee4c0417e60212.webm?t=1772558668\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2430390/extras/724022aab8d2b27f98ee4c0417e60212.mp4?t=1772558668\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scavenge the world for <strong>Dysplaced Artifacts\u00a0</strong>\u2014 modern items that have seeped from our realm into theirs. Some are incredibly powerful, and the locals mistake them for magic. You can even learn to craft local counterparts, like grenades forged in copper or bronze casings.  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2430390/extras/145b2ff649ac066c3e09264479eb451d.webp?t=1772558668\" alt=\"The Rise of the Eternals\" width=780 height=53 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2430390/extras/2e7eec8cb6edff0a0e8653fa57780b69.avif?t=1772558668\" width=1170 height=914 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you arrive, a sinister force consumes the realm\u2014spreading chaos and driving its people into exile. They are called <strong>the Eternals</strong>, and you have been called to fight them. Are you ready to steel yourself against the scourge devouring these lands?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2430390/extras/248585dcb9e1557a23b483fc26e7e608.webp?t=1772558668\" alt=\"Play Together\" width=780 height=53 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2430390/extras/533704c7b05c2ac257129cb006ef36fd.poster.avif?t=1772558668\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2430390/extras/533704c7b05c2ac257129cb006ef36fd.webm?t=1772558668\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2430390/extras/533704c7b05c2ac257129cb006ef36fd.mp4?t=1772558668\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can conquer this strange new world alone\u2014or bring a friend. Prepare for a shared experience in a dream-infused world where everyone can find both <strong>tranquility</strong> and <strong>adventure</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2430390/extras/3f38cc3552ff208fa06ce998eaf1df25.webp?t=1772558668\" alt=\"Early Access\" width=780 height=53 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game already has the majority of features and a large part of final content at its current state. The main things which are in development are rest of the content (~50-60%) and couch co-op functionality. During early access we plan add rest of the content and couch co-op. We also plan to add features and functionality not specified here yet - what we add depends on the feedback during the Early Access.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In our experience the Early Access model will result in a better game: We'll have more time to develop the game together with a more extensive audience than we can reach with our internal testing. We will create the remaining part of the game in any case, so it's better to create the rest of the game with more feedback.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Early adopters tend to be the most passionate and vocal players \u2014 their feedback on things like difficulty balance, progression pacing, and missing quality-of-life features is invaluable and hard to replicate internally.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We'll be actively present on our Discord server and Steam forums, listening to player feedback and engaging in discussion. We update the game regularly, and our in-game changelog keeps the community informed of every change. </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2430390?t=1772558668","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2430390/3d142d245db18a594e18ac72117d77a413395083/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772558668","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2430390/fe68b0a54b0cdf307cb928a18e10cfa76c5fbef2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772558668","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2430390/fe68b0a54b0cdf307cb928a18e10cfa76c5fbef2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772558668","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Remote Play on TV","id":43},{"description":"HDR available","id":61},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2430390/extras/2187464505e2b8c47a3b9ef6aea8de88.poster.avif?t=1772558668\" width=780 height=202 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2430390/extras/2187464505e2b8c47a3b9ef6aea8de88.webm?t=1772558668\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2430390/extras/2187464505e2b8c47a3b9ef6aea8de88.mp4?t=1772558668\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enter a beautiful realm being torn apart by long-forgotten, newly risen dark powers.\u00a0</strong>Through the cracks caused by this upheaval, our world is seeping into theirs. You are called upon to combat the darkness transforming the realm into something terrifying and inhospitable to all life\u2014all except the corrupted <strong>Eternals</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a realm desperate for a savior\u2014to unveil its secrets and fend off the looming catastrophe.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u2694\ufe0f Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udca5 <strong>Nearly every object can be broken down for materials</strong><br>\ud83d\ude4e\u200d\u2640\ufe0f <strong>Meet the denizens of the realm</strong> and help them survive the coming apocalypse<br>\ud83e\udded <strong>Explore a vast world</strong> of beauty\u2014and darkness<br>\ud83c\udfd5\ufe0f <strong>Construct</strong> campsites, outposts, and even houses<br>\ud83d\udde1\ufe0f <strong>Craft equipment</strong> and create custom weapons<br>\ud83d\udee1\ufe0f <strong>Shape your hero</strong> from scratch<br>\ud83d\udd2b <strong>Find and craft dysplaced modern items</strong>\u2014the locals believe they\u2019re magical <br>\ud83e\ude78 <strong>Brew potions</strong> to gain a tactical advantage<br>\ud83e\udd9e <strong>Cook mouth-watering meals</strong> for extra vigor and other boons<br>\ud83e\udddb\u200d\u2642\ufe0f <strong>Fight against the shadowy forces</strong> menacing your new home<br>\ud83c\udfa3 <strong>Fish</strong> in murky, forgotten lakes for mysterious catches<br>\ud83d\udc1d <strong>Catch critters</strong> for crafting\u2014or collect them just because you can</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2430390/extras/21be2cb74eb4081579d97df434cff278.webp?t=1772558668\" alt=\"Forge From The Ruins\" width=780 height=53 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2430390/extras/a0e402ca51959c602b12e25461760930.poster.avif?t=1772558668\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2430390/extras/a0e402ca51959c602b12e25461760930.webm?t=1772558668\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2430390/extras/a0e402ca51959c602b12e25461760930.mp4?t=1772558668\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nearly everything in this massive world is destructible: trees, wheelbarrows, plows, barrels\u2014even houses. Gather materials to learn new skills and craft a wide array of items. Use your axe, hammer, sword or powerful modern tools to <strong>destroy nearly everything</strong>!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2430390/extras/b39f3c782391f6436bb9af91a0970b91.webp?t=1772558668\" alt=\"Craft &amp; Customize\" width=780 height=53 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2430390/extras/21256b7bc8094d849c359fa6e7373d34.poster.avif?t=1772558668\" width=616 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2430390/extras/21256b7bc8094d849c359fa6e7373d34.webm?t=1772558668\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2430390/extras/21256b7bc8094d849c359fa6e7373d34.mp4?t=1772558668\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft and customize a vast array of weapons, armor, and tools to grow stronger. Create gear that fits your playstyle: block and parry with sword and shield, hurl deadly spears, or strike from afar with a bow. Spice it up with scavenged modern artifacts \u2014 grenades, mines, and shotguns \u2014 or build an anvil to mix and match blades and hilts for unique weapon combinations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2430390/extras/9d668a2a2ac8808783040a1b2df14a9e.poster.avif?t=1772558668\" width=616 height=205 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2430390/extras/9d668a2a2ac8808783040a1b2df14a9e.webm?t=1772558668\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2430390/extras/13476528691c69faba52402a7a171b65.webp?t=1772558668\" alt=\"Explore &amp; Build\" width=780 height=53 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2430390/extras/72505378796671eccfcc33dff2e17e7c.poster.avif?t=1772558668\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2430390/extras/72505378796671eccfcc33dff2e17e7c.webm?t=1772558668\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2430390/extras/72505378796671eccfcc33dff2e17e7c.mp4?t=1772558668\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once equipped for the journey, a vast and enchanting realm awaits. Gather resources, hunt wildlife, farm local plants gather herbs, shrooms and berries, uncover hidden treasures, complete mysterious quests, and brave awe-inspiring wonders and dangers alike.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make a campfire, build a workbench, forge, or even a teleporter \u2014 or craft a full house! Venture further by establishing campsites and outposts along the way. A well-equipped outpost can make all the difference when facing the challenges of this strange new frontier.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2430390/extras/a7f92c55faedf6839c5f23017c562ef6.webp?t=1772558668\" alt=\"Dysplaced Artifacts\" width=780 height=53 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2430390/extras/724022aab8d2b27f98ee4c0417e60212.poster.avif?t=1772558668\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2430390/extras/724022aab8d2b27f98ee4c0417e60212.webm?t=1772558668\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2430390/extras/724022aab8d2b27f98ee4c0417e60212.mp4?t=1772558668\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scavenge the world for <strong>Dysplaced Artifacts\u00a0</strong>\u2014 modern items that have seeped from our realm into theirs. Some are incredibly powerful, and the locals mistake them for magic. You can even learn to craft local counterparts, like grenades forged in copper or bronze casings.  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2430390/extras/145b2ff649ac066c3e09264479eb451d.webp?t=1772558668\" alt=\"The Rise of the Eternals\" width=780 height=53 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2430390/extras/2e7eec8cb6edff0a0e8653fa57780b69.avif?t=1772558668\" width=1170 height=914 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you arrive, a sinister force consumes the realm\u2014spreading chaos and driving its people into exile. They are called <strong>the Eternals</strong>, and you have been called to fight them. Are you ready to steel yourself against the scourge devouring these lands?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2430390/extras/248585dcb9e1557a23b483fc26e7e608.webp?t=1772558668\" alt=\"Play Together\" width=780 height=53 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2430390/extras/533704c7b05c2ac257129cb006ef36fd.poster.avif?t=1772558668\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2430390/extras/533704c7b05c2ac257129cb006ef36fd.webm?t=1772558668\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2430390/extras/533704c7b05c2ac257129cb006ef36fd.mp4?t=1772558668\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can conquer this strange new world alone\u2014or bring a friend. Prepare for a shared experience in a dream-infused world where everyone can find both <strong>tranquility</strong> and <strong>adventure</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2430390/extras/3f38cc3552ff208fa06ce998eaf1df25.webp?t=1772558668\" alt=\"Early Access\" width=780 height=53 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game already has the majority of features and a large part of final content at its current state. The main things which are in development are rest of the content (~50-60%) and couch co-op functionality. During early access we plan add rest of the content and couch co-op. We also plan to add features and functionality not specified here yet - what we add depends on the feedback during the Early Access.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In our experience the Early Access model will result in a better game: We'll have more time to develop the game together with a more extensive audience than we can reach with our internal testing. We will create the remaining part of the game in any case, so it's better to create the rest of the game with more feedback.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Early adopters tend to be the most passionate and vocal players \u2014 their feedback on things like difficulty balance, progression pacing, and missing quality-of-life features is invaluable and hard to replicate internally.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We'll be actively present on our Discord server and Steam forums, listening to player feedback and engaging in discussion. We update the game regularly, and our in-game changelog keeps the community informed of every change. </p>","developers":["10tons Ltd"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2430390/7339f9a993b9bba2c762e0aab53b0673292e78db/header.jpg?t=1772558668","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_r