en world, master its secrets, and forge salvation from the ruins. Sometimes, saving the world means destroying it first.","steam_appid":2430390,"support_info":{"email":"","url":"http://www.10tons.com"},"supported_languages":"English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support","type":"game","website":"http://dysplaced.com"}